Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:34.41,ED_JP_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6\3c&H1F3B79&}遠くで声が響く
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.41,0:22:36.79,ED_JP_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6\3c&H1F3B79&}届かない夢
