Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.87,0:23:19.96,ED_JP_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6\fscx60\fscy60\3c&H6C8CAF&\pos(894,995.857)}あす
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.71,0:23:28.68,ED_JP_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6\3c&H936D45&}何度でも立ち上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.59,0:22:08.14,ED_CN_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6}在光照不到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:16.60,ED_CN_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6}我獨自尋覓著什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:24.45,ED_CN_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6\3c&HDF4D7A&}持杖所需的那份堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.45,0:22:30.87,ED_CN_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6\3c&HDF4D7A&}我從未擁有一分一毫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:34.41,ED_CN_EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur6\3c&H1F3B79&}遠方迴響著呼喚
